# The repository root .gitignore excludes *.md, *.txt and *.pdb globally, and
# several data directories entirely. smoke/ is a self-contained handoff package,
# so those global exclusions are lifted here and nowhere else.
#
# Checked against the root file on 2026-09-19: the global patterns are
# *.swp *.swo *.kate-swp *.pdb *.md *.txt *.tar.gz. Only the last four could
# ever match content in this folder.
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.pdb
